---@field name? string Identifier. The resource name of the quota group. Format: accounts/{account}/quotas/{group} Note: There is no guarantee on the format of {group}
---@field methodDetails? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_quota_v1.MethodDetailsList Output only. List of all methods group quota applies to.
---@field quotaMinuteLimit? string Output only. The maximum number of calls allowed per minute for the group.
---@field quotaUsage? string Output only. The current quota usage, meaning the number of calls already made on a given day to the methods in the group. The daily quota limits reset at 12:00 PM midday UTC.
---@field quotaLimit? string Output only. The maximum number of calls allowed per day for the group.

---@alias gcp.unstable.merchantapi_quota_v1.QuotaGroupList gcp.unstable.merchantapi_quota_v1.QuotaGroup[]

